  "text": "By using an autoencoder to map the high-dimensional state to a complex-valued latent space, where each latent variable evolves independently under a time-continuous linear ODE, z' = \u03bbz. The complex \u03bb acts like an eigenvalue: its real part sets growth or decay, and its imaginary part sets the periodic component. The autoencoder and \u03bb are trained together with a combined reconstruction and latent-propagation loss. The probabilistic version replaces the ODE with an Ornstein-Uhlenbeck SDE and the autoencoder with a variational autoencoder.",
